OL,3,AFatbergs, feathers and flocks of sheep
OL,4,A- inside the new London Museum
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I really love this space, it just
OL,7,Fmakes me smile every time I come in -
OL,8,Fit's actually joyful," she says.
OL,10,FThe vast room, now known as Our Time,
OL,11,Fis dotted with installations reflecting
OL,12,Fliving memory.
